<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Shinawatra Q2 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Shinawatra Q2 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     4.34	 vs	     4.86</p>
<p>    Net		    601.03	 vs	   674.09</p>
<p>				   Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     7.96	 vs	    10.52</p>
<p>    Net		  1,102.61	 vs	 1,458.66</p>
<p>Notes: Results are audited. The company's full name is Shinwatra Computer and Communication Plc, a telecommunication firm.</p>
